      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "고고트 운송업을 시작했는데\n우리 회사 아이들은 다들 아담해서 말이야.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĳ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 176,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ACE0ACE0D2B80020C6B4C1A1C5C5C7440020C2DCC791D588B294B370000AC6B0B9AC0020D68CC0AC0020C544C774B4E4C7400020B2E4B4E40020C544B2F4D574C11C0020B9D0C774C57C002E00100002011401330000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "더 커다란 고고트가 있으면\n커다란 짐도 옮길 수 있을 텐데...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĳ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 264,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B3540020CEE4B2E4B7800020ACE0ACE0D2B8AC000020C788C73CBA74000ACEE4B2E4B7800020C9D0B3C40020C62EAE380020C2180020C788C7440020D150B370002E002E002E00100002011401330000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "저기, 혹시 XL 사이즈의 고고트가 있다면\n나한테 주지 않을래?<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n‘능력치를 본다’를 통해\n포켓몬의 사이즈를 알 수 있을 거야!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĳ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 344,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 78
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0004>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 500,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00040000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "XL 사이즈의 고고트를\n나한테 줄 거니?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĳ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 512,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0058004C0020C0ACC774C988C7580020ACE0ACE0D2B8B97C000AB098D55CD14C0020C9040020AC70B2C8003F00100002011401330000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "여기요!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 568,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C5ECAE30C69400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "사양할게요",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 580,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C0ACC591D560AC8CC6940000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "오오!\n어떤 고고트니!?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĳ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 592,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C624C6240021000AC5B4B5A40020ACE0ACE0D2B8B2C80021003F00100002011401330000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "XL 사이즈의 고고트를\n잡게 되면 나한테 줘!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĳ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 628,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0058004C0020C0ACC774C988C7580020ACE0ACE0D2B8B97C000AC7A1AC8C0020B418BA740020B098D55CD14C0020C918002100100002011401330000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그 녀석은 XL 사이즈가 아닌걸.\n더 커다란 사이즈의 고고트를 부탁할게.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĳ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 688,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF80020B140C11DC74000200058004C0020C0ACC774C988AC000020C544B2CCAC78002E000AB3540020CEE4B2E4B7800020C0ACC774C988C7580020ACE0ACE0D2B8B97C0020BD80D0C1D560AC8C002E00100002011401330000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "오옷! 커다란 고고트구나!\n딱 봐도 XL 사이즈네!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĳ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 780,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C624C63700210020CEE4B2E4B7800020ACE0ACE0D2B8AD6CB0980021000AB5310020BD10B3C400200058004C0020C0ACC774C988B124002100100002011401330000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "우와아! 뭐야, 이 사이즈는!?\n상상한 것보다 훨씬 더 큰데!?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĳ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 848,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C6B0C640C54400210020BB50C57C002C0020C7740020C0ACC774C988B2940021003F000AC0C1C0C1D55C0020AC83BCF4B2E40020D6E8C52C0020B3540020D070B3700021003F00100002011401330000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "짐도 잔뜩 옮길 수 있겠는걸!\n앞으로의 활약을 기대할게!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĳ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 928,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C9D0B3C40020C794B7290020C62EAE380020C2180020C788ACA0B294AC780021000AC55EC73CB85CC7580020D65CC57DC7440020AE30B300D560AC8C002100100002011401330000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "메메~멧!!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1000,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BA54BA54007EBA67002100210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "고메에...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1016,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ACE0BA54C5D0002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "어이쿠! 너희들의 존재도 물론\n잊지 않았다구!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĳ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1032,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C5B4C774CFE000210020B108D76CB4E4C7580020C874C7ACB3C40020BB3CB860000AC78AC9C00020C54AC558B2E4AD6C002100100002011401330000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "한때 고고셔틀로서 도시를 누비며\n구석구석까지 훤히 꿰고 있는 너희들인걸.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n신입 고고트에게도\n도시에 대해 이것저것 가르쳐 주렴!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĳ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1092,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 78
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1248,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "수년 전에는 공공 교통 시설로\n고고셔틀을 운영했었어.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n하지만 미르도 바뀌었으니\n포켓몬과 새로운 사업을 하고 싶어서 말이야!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĳ",
